Z||000004||fierobear||10-29-2001||01:26 PM||||I've been thinking of building a street racer. I'd start with an 88 frame, put the Indy interior and exterior, build up a 3.4 pushrod motor to the hilt and turbocharge it. I'd find the right transmission/gearing combo and go out and eat vettes and stangs.<P>Wuddya think?||||reg||1
